  "body": "Warm and Sunny north facing elevated suntrap, walking distance to beach, shops, amenities and schools.\r\nViews of the gulf and Orewa town centre.\r\nEnd of quiet cul-de-sac. \r\n524sq m site.\r\nInternal Double garage.\r\n3 Double bedroom and study.\r\nSpacious enclosed conservatory.\r\nLarge pantry room off kitchen.\r\nImpressive living/dining room area with wrap around decks.\r\nGas heating, hot water and cooking.\r\nFully insulated.\r\nOff street parking for multiple vehicles.\r\nSeparate office and toilet off garage.\r\nLarge storage areas (Potential to develop space under house).\r\nReady to move in right now.",
